        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(plugins): validate pattern-based and conditional config schemas",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nFixes an issue where plugin config schemas with an empty explicit `properties` map were classified as empty even when `patternProperties`, `dependentSchemas`, or an active `if` plus `then`/`else` conditional imposed real validation rules. Valid pattern-keyed plugin configuration could therefore be rejected as “config must be empty,” while active conditional constraints could be skipped.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nThe empty-schema shortcut now recognizes pattern and dependency constraints and only treats conditionals as active when `if` is paired with `then` or `else`. Standalone `if`, `then`, and `else` remain on the empty-config path because JSON Schema gives them no independent validation effect.\n\nThe implementation was checked against the repository's actual validator dependency, TypeBox 1.3.3: its coverage table and compiler source support `patternProperties`, `dependentSchemas`, and `if/then/else`, and its conditional engine defaults missing branches to `true`.\n\n## User Impact\n\nPlugin authors can use pattern-keyed and active conditional config schemas without the loader incorrectly requiring an empty config. Semantically inactive standalone conditional keywords do not bypass the empty-config guard.\n\n## Evidence\n\nExact PR head `5b0e801a35f614d6a3007ece6ef215a07c2a5461`, directly invoking the production `validatePluginConfig` integration path:\n\n```text\npattern-valid: {\"ok\":true,\"value\":{\"S_SETTING\":\"configured\"}}\npattern-invalid: {\"ok\":false,\"error\":[\"S_SETTING: must be string\"]}\nactive-then: {\"ok\":false,\"error\":[\"<root>: must match \\\"then\\\" schema\"]}\nstandalone-if: {\"ok\":false,\"error\":[\"<root>: config must be empty\"]}\nstandalone-then: {\"ok\":false,\"error\":[\"<root>: config must be empty\"]}\nstandalone-else: {\"ok\":false,\"error\":[\"<root>: config must be empty\"]}\nexact_head=5b0e801a35f614d6a3007ece6ef215a07c2a5461\n```\n\nFocused loader regression test:\n\n```text\n$ node scripts/run-vitest.mjs src/plugins/loader-shared.test.ts\nTest Files  1 passed (1)\nTests       7 passed (7)\n```\n\nAdditional checks:\n\n```text\n$ ./node_modules/.bin/oxfmt --check src/plugins/loader-shared.ts src/plugins/loader-shared.test.ts\nAll matched files use the correct format.\n\n$ ./node_modules/.bin/oxlint src/plugins/loader-shared.test.ts\n# no output\n\n$ git diff --check\n# no output\n```\n\nFresh autoreview was attempted before commit, but the engine failed before producing findings because the Responses WebSocket returned HTTP 403. No autoreview-clean claim is made.\n\nAI-assisted: yes. I reviewed the complete empty-schema decision, both loader callers, the production schema validator, and TypeBox's direct dependency contract.\n",
        "branch": "fix/plugin-config-empty-schema-keywords",
